Compile-time and container-runtime dependency jars for Gumdrop.

Populated by `ant resolve-deps` (downloads from GitHub Releases and Maven Central).
Version pins live in `boms/versions.properties`.

J2EE API jars are bundled into gumdrop-container.jar at build time and loaded by
ContainerClassLoader at runtime, isolating servlet implementations from Gumdrop
internals.

Also includes gonzalez (XML), jsonparser (JSON), agent15 + hkdf (QUIC / TLS 1.3).

Only README is tracked in git; jars are downloaded locally (see .gitignore).
